									<div id="faq-module" data-module-name="MwmAnchor"></div>
									<div id="mod-6" class="mwm-mod mwm-global-styles mwm-faq mwm-palette-3" data-tn-component="mod6MwmFaq" data-module-name="MwmFaq">
	<div class="mwm-mod__container">
		<div class="mwm-mod__content">
			<div class="mwm-mod__copy">
					<div class="mwm-module-heading mwm-module-heading--cta-right mod-heading mod-heading--cta-right ">
		<div class="mwm-module-heading__left mod-heading__left">
								<h2 class="mwm-eyebrow mod-heading__eyebrow">
		FAQ	</h2>
																		</div>
					<div class="mwm-module-heading__right mod-heading__right">
				
			</div>
			</div>
	<div class="mwm-faq__count mwm-faq--accordion accordionmod-6">
				<div class="mwm-faq__card row" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
			<div class="mwm-faq__counter col-1"></div>
				<div class="col">
					<button class="mwm-faq__button mwm-faq__question" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#mod-6-collapse-0" aria-expanded="false">
						Can I post a job for free* on Indeed?						<div class="mwm-faq__svg">
							<span class="indeed-icon embed-icon icon-angle-down " aria-hidden="true"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M7.7574 8.8178C7.36688 8.42727 6.73371 8.42727 6.34319 8.8178C5.95266 9.20832 5.95266 9.84148 6.34319 10.232L11.2853 15.1741C11.2878 15.1767 11.2903 15.1792 11.2929 15.1818C11.4881 15.377 11.7441 15.4747 12 15.4746C12.2559 15.4747 12.5119 15.377 12.7071 15.1818C12.7097 15.1792 12.7122 15.1767 12.7147 15.1741L17.6568 10.232C18.0473 9.84148 18.0473 9.20832 17.6568 8.8178C17.2663 8.42727 16.6331 8.42727 16.2426 8.8178L12 13.0604L7.7574 8.8178Z" />
</svg>
</span></span>						</div>
					</button>
					<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" id="mod-6-collapse-0" class="collapse mwm-faq__answer ignore-visibility-check" aria-labelledby="mod-6-heading-0">
						<div id="mod-6-heading-0" itemprop="text">
							<p>Yes, up to a limit. You can post 3 free <a href="#mod-9"> *  </a> jobs per month directly on Indeed (Hosted Jobs). Important Note on Indexed Jobs: If your jobs are automatically “pulled” or indexed from your career site or ATS, these generally do not count toward your monthly free job limit. Free postings may lose visibility over time, so if you have high-volume hiring needs or have reached your monthly limit, sponsoring your jobs is the best way to maintain visibility.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<button aria-label="close" class="mwm-faq__button--close mwm-faq__question" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#mod-6-collapse-0" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="-1">
						<div class="mwm-faq__svg">
							<span class="indeed-icon embed-icon icon-angle-down " aria-hidden="true"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M7.7574 8.8178C7.36688 8.42727 6.73371 8.42727 6.34319 8.8178C5.95266 9.20832 5.95266 9.84148 6.34319 10.232L11.2853 15.1741C11.2878 15.1767 11.2903 15.1792 11.2929 15.1818C11.4881 15.377 11.7441 15.4747 12 15.4746C12.2559 15.4747 12.5119 15.377 12.7071 15.1818C12.7097 15.1792 12.7122 15.1767 12.7147 15.1741L17.6568 10.232C18.0473 9.84148 18.0473 9.20832 17.6568 8.8178C17.2663 8.42727 16.6331 8.42727 16.2426 8.8178L12 13.0604L7.7574 8.8178Z" />
</svg>
</span></span>						</div>
					</button>
				</div>
		</div>

				<div class="mwm-faq__card row" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
			<div class="mwm-faq__counter col-1"></div>
				<div class="col">
					<button class="mwm-faq__button mwm-faq__question" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#mod-6-collapse-1" aria-expanded="false">
						What’s the minimum price I can set for a Sponsored Job on Indeed?						<div class="mwm-faq__svg">
							<span class="indeed-icon embed-icon icon-angle-down " aria-hidden="true"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M7.7574 8.8178C7.36688 8.42727 6.73371 8.42727 6.34319 8.8178C5.95266 9.20832 5.95266 9.84148 6.34319 10.232L11.2853 15.1741C11.2878 15.1767 11.2903 15.1792 11.2929 15.1818C11.4881 15.377 11.7441 15.4747 12 15.4746C12.2559 15.4747 12.5119 15.377 12.7071 15.1818C12.7097 15.1792 12.7122 15.1767 12.7147 15.1741L17.6568 10.232C18.0473 9.84148 18.0473 9.20832 17.6568 8.8178C17.2663 8.42727 16.6331 8.42727 16.2426 8.8178L12 13.0604L7.7574 8.8178Z" />
</svg>
</span></span>						</div>
					</button>
					<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" id="mod-6-collapse-1" class="collapse mwm-faq__answer ignore-visibility-check" aria-labelledby="mod-6-heading-1">
						<div id="mod-6-heading-1" itemprop="text">
							<p>The minimum price will appear on the product sponsorship page and will depend on several factors, including available job seekers in your market, similar job posts bidding for priority placement, the type of Sponsored Jobs plan you select, among others.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<button aria-label="close" class="mwm-faq__button--close mwm-faq__question" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#mod-6-collapse-1" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="-1">
						<div class="mwm-faq__svg">
							<span class="indeed-icon embed-icon icon-angle-down " aria-hidden="true"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M7.7574 8.8178C7.36688 8.42727 6.73371 8.42727 6.34319 8.8178C5.95266 9.20832 5.95266 9.84148 6.34319 10.232L11.2853 15.1741C11.2878 15.1767 11.2903 15.1792 11.2929 15.1818C11.4881 15.377 11.7441 15.4747 12 15.4746C12.2559 15.4747 12.5119 15.377 12.7071 15.1818C12.7097 15.1792 12.7122 15.1767 12.7147 15.1741L17.6568 10.232C18.0473 9.84148 18.0473 9.20832 17.6568 8.8178C17.2663 8.42727 16.6331 8.42727 16.2426 8.8178L12 13.0604L7.7574 8.8178Z" />
