		</div>

				<div class="mwm-faq__card row" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
			<div class="mwm-faq__counter col-1"></div>
				<div class="col">
					<button class="mwm-faq__button mwm-faq__question" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#mod-6-collapse-2" aria-expanded="false">
						How does Indeed set the Standard price?						<div class="mwm-faq__svg">
							<span class="indeed-icon embed-icon icon-angle-down " aria-hidden="true"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M7.7574 8.8178C7.36688 8.42727 6.73371 8.42727 6.34319 8.8178C5.95266 9.20832 5.95266 9.84148 6.34319 10.232L11.2853 15.1741C11.2878 15.1767 11.2903 15.1792 11.2929 15.1818C11.4881 15.377 11.7441 15.4747 12 15.4746C12.2559 15.4747 12.5119 15.377 12.7071 15.1818C12.7097 15.1792 12.7122 15.1767 12.7147 15.1741L17.6568 10.232C18.0473 9.84148 18.0473 9.20832 17.6568 8.8178C17.2663 8.42727 16.6331 8.42727 16.2426 8.8178L12 13.0604L7.7574 8.8178Z" />
</svg>
</span></span>						</div>
					</button>
					<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" id="mod-6-collapse-2" class="collapse mwm-faq__answer ignore-visibility-check" aria-labelledby="mod-6-heading-2">
						<div id="mod-6-heading-2" itemprop="text">
							<p>The Standard price is generated based on Indeed’s recommendation system, which takes into account market factors such as job competitiveness, your hiring timeline and the supply of job seekers for specific job titles, among other factors. </p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<button aria-label="close" class="mwm-faq__button--close mwm-faq__question" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#mod-6-collapse-2" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="-1">
						<div class="mwm-faq__svg">
							<span class="indeed-icon embed-icon icon-angle-down " aria-hidden="true"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M7.7574 8.8178C7.36688 8.42727 6.73371 8.42727 6.34319 8.8178C5.95266 9.20832 5.95266 9.84148 6.34319 10.232L11.2853 15.1741C11.2878 15.1767 11.2903 15.1792 11.2929 15.1818C11.4881 15.377 11.7441 15.4747 12 15.4746C12.2559 15.4747 12.5119 15.377 12.7071 15.1818C12.7097 15.1792 12.7122 15.1767 12.7147 15.1741L17.6568 10.232C18.0473 9.84148 18.0473 9.20832 17.6568 8.8178C17.2663 8.42727 16.6331 8.42727 16.2426 8.8178L12 13.0604L7.7574 8.8178Z" />
