</span></span>						</div>
					</button>
				</div>
		</div>

				<div class="mwm-faq__card row" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
			<div class="mwm-faq__counter col-1"></div>
				<div class="col">
					<button class="mwm-faq__button mwm-faq__question" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#mod-6-collapse-3" aria-expanded="false">
						How does Indeed set the Premium price?						<div class="mwm-faq__svg">
							<span class="indeed-icon embed-icon icon-angle-down " aria-hidden="true"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M7.7574 8.8178C7.36688 8.42727 6.73371 8.42727 6.34319 8.8178C5.95266 9.20832 5.95266 9.84148 6.34319 10.232L11.2853 15.1741C11.2878 15.1767 11.2903 15.1792 11.2929 15.1818C11.4881 15.377 11.7441 15.4747 12 15.4746C12.2559 15.4747 12.5119 15.377 12.7071 15.1818C12.7097 15.1792 12.7122 15.1767 12.7147 15.1741L17.6568 10.232C18.0473 9.84148 18.0473 9.20832 17.6568 8.8178C17.2663 8.42727 16.6331 8.42727 16.2426 8.8178L12 13.0604L7.7574 8.8178Z" />
</svg>
</span></span>						</div>
					</button>
					<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" id="mod-6-collapse-3" class="collapse mwm-faq__answer ignore-visibility-check" aria-labelledby="mod-6-heading-3">
						<div id="mod-6-heading-3" itemprop="text">
							<p>The Premium price is set above the Standard price to help ensure more applications from quality candidates quickly compared to Standard Sponsored Jobs. This way, your Premium Sponsored Job is competitive against similar roles on Indeed. </p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<button aria-label="close" class="mwm-faq__button--close mwm-faq__question" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#mod-6-collapse-3" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="-1">
						<div class="mwm-faq__svg">
							<span class="indeed-icon embed-icon icon-angle-down " aria-hidden="true"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M7.7574 8.8178C7.36688 8.42727 6.73371 8.42727 6.34319 8.8178C5.95266 9.20832 5.95266 9.84148 6.34319 10.232L11.2853 15.1741C11.2878 15.1767 11.2903 15.1792 11.2929 15.1818C11.4881 15.377 11.7441 15.4747 12 15.4746C12.2559 15.4747 12.5119 15.377 12.7071 15.1818C12.7097 15.1792 12.7122 15.1767 12.7147 15.1741L17.6568 10.232C18.0473 9.84148 18.0473 9.20832 17.6568 8.8178C17.2663 8.42727 16.6331 8.42727 16.2426 8.8178L12 13.0604L7.7574 8.8178Z" />
</svg>
</span></span>						</div>
					</button>
				</div>
		</div>

				<div class="mwm-faq__card row" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
			<div class="mwm-faq__counter col-1"></div>
				<div class="col">
					<button class="mwm-faq__button mwm-faq__question" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#mod-6-collapse-4" aria-expanded="false">
						Do I have to accept the price that Indeed recommends?						<div class="mwm-faq__svg">
							<span class="indeed-icon embed-icon icon-angle-down " aria-hidden="true"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M7.7574 8.8178C7.36688 8.42727 6.73371 8.42727 6.34319 8.8178C5.95266 9.20832 5.95266 9.84148 6.34319 10.232L11.2853 15.1741C11.2878 15.1767 11.2903 15.1792 11.2929 15.1818C11.4881 15.377 11.7441 15.4747 12 15.4746C12.2559 15.4747 12.5119 15.377 12.7071 15.1818C12.7097 15.1792 12.7122 15.1767 12.7147 15.1741L17.6568 10.232C18.0473 9.84148 18.0473 9.20832 17.6568 8.8178C17.2663 8.42727 16.6331 8.42727 16.2426 8.8178L12 13.0604L7.7574 8.8178Z" />
</svg>
</span></span>						</div>
					</button>
					<div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" id="mod-6-collapse-4" class="collapse mwm-faq__answer ignore-visibility-check" aria-labelledby="mod-6-heading-4">
						<div id="mod-6-heading-4" itemprop="text">
							<p>No. You’re free to set a different amount as long as it meets the minimum required for that job.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<button aria-label="close" class="mwm-faq__button--close mwm-faq__question" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#mod-6-collapse-4" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="-1">
